{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/neuron\/mixtureofexperts"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron"]]},"metadata":{"title":"MixtureOfExperts","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MixtureOfExperts","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Neuron"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MixtureOfExperts"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:6Neuron16MixtureOfExpertsC","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class"},"abstract":[{"text":"A sparse mixture-of-experts feed-forward layer, the MLP of a GPT-4-shaped (Switch \/ Mixtral)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transformer block: a router sends each token through ","type":"text"},{"code":"k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":"E","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" expert MLPs and blends their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outputs by gate weight.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/BaseLayer"]},{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/Layer","doc:\/\/Neuron\/Se","doc:\/\/Neuron\/SE"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MixtureOfExperts","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":" (a row of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"text":" features) is processed independently:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["z      = x W_rᵀ                                     router logits (E)","g      = softmax over the top k of z, 0 elsewhere   gates; Σ g = 1","eₑ(x)  = W2ₑ GeLU(W1ₑ x + b1ₑ) + b2ₑ                expert e, hidden width F","y      = Σₑ gₑ eₑ(x)                                only the k nonzero gates contribute"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The softmax over the top ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"k"},{"text":" is the full softmax restricted to them and renormalized. Top-k","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selection isn’t differentiable: the router’s gradient flows only through the kept gates, and an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expert a token didn’t choose gets no gradient from it. Ties go to the lower expert.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute (dense-gated).","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Every expert runs on every token and the unkept gates zero their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outputs, so the result and every gradient are what sparse dispatch would give, at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"E \/ k"},{"text":" times","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the feed-forward compute. Nothing is read on the CPU mid-pass and every shape is fixed. Because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the second projection is linear, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Σₑ gₑ (W2ₑ hₑ + b2ₑ) = (g ⊙ h) W2ᵀ + g b2"},{"text":", with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"repeated over each expert’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"F"},{"text":" hidden units: the whole layer is five matrix products (router,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first projections, gate expansion, second projections, biases) and a top-k softmax. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docs\/LEARNINGS.md"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Load balancing.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Without help the router collapses onto a few experts. When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loadBalancingCoefficient"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"α"},{"text":") is above 0, training adds the Switch Transformer auxiliary loss","type":"text"}]},{"code":["L_aux = E · Σᵢ fᵢ Pᵢ,  fᵢ = share of the batch's n·k assignments that went to expert i","                       Pᵢ = mean router probability softmax(z)ᵢ over the batch's n tokens"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"which is 1 when routing is perfectly balanced. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"f"},{"text":" counts selections, so it has no gradient.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The layer adds ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"α"},{"text":"-weighted ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"L_aux"},{"text":" gradients in its own backward, as one more per-token loss","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"term: every token’s router probabilities receive ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"α · E · f"},{"text":". That is the weight a per-token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loss carries in Neuron, whose losses sum a sequence’s per-token gradients, so ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"α"},{"text":" means what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does in Switch (0.01). The balancing gradient mixes the batch’s tokens, and it is added only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the forward ran in training. It isn’t part of the loss the optimizer reports; read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loadBalancingLoss"},{"text":" for it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameters.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" One row per output feature, as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Linear"},{"text":" and PyTorch’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nn.Linear.weight"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store them:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"W_r","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"(columns: C, rows: E)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", no bias."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"W1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"(columns: C, rows: E·F)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": rows "},{"code":"e·F..<(e+1)·F","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are expert "},{"code":"e","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s first projection."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"b1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"(columns: E·F)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", in the same order."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"W2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"(columns: E·F, rows: C)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": columns "},{"code":"e·F..<(e+1)·F","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are expert "},{"code":"e","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s second projection."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"b2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"(columns: C, rows: E)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": row "},{"code":"e","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is expert "},{"code":"e","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weights"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"W_r | W1 | W2"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"biases"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"b1 | b2"},{"text":", packed flat, the layout the backward","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns gradients in. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Adam"},{"text":" decays ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weights"},{"text":", router included, unless ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allowsWeightDecay"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", and never decays biases.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each sample is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(columns: C, rows: R, depth: D)"},{"text":", read as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"R·D"},{"text":" tokens, and the output has the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same shape. The layer is position-wise, so it accepts sequences shorter than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inputSize.depth"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Every forward pass receives the whole mini-batch packed into one tensor (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size.batchCount"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"samples of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inputSize"},{"text":"). See ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docs\/WRITING_A_LAYER.md"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MixtureOfExperts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MixtureOfExperts\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MixtureOfExperts\/init(inputSize:experts:topK:hiddenUnits:loadBalancingCoefficient:initializer:outputInitializer:allowsWeightDecay:linkId:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","